874	     * Reduces an owner to its derived {@code identityKey}, formatted
875	     * {@code '<normalizedTelephone>|<email>|<householdId>'}: the owner's telephone reduced to its
876	     * canonical E.164 form (see {@link TelephoneNormalizer#canonicalize(String)}), the owner's
877	     * normalized (lower-cased) email or the empty string when absent (see
878	     * {@link EmailNormalizer#normalize(String)}), and the owner's {@code householdId} or the empty
879	     * string when absent, joined by {@code '|'}. Two owners are duplicates exactly when their whole
880	     * identity keys are equal. The key never contains {@code null} segments, so the create endpoint's
881	     * single duplicate check compares this one value across owners.
