641	     * Counts the existing owners whose {@code city} matches the given city, compared
642	     * case-insensitively (see {@link #equalsIgnoreCase(String, String)}). Used by the per-city
643	     * capacity check ({@link #rejectCityAtCapacity(String)}) to count a city's owners.
644	     *
645	     * @param city the city to count owners for
646	     * @return the number of existing owners in that city
647	     */
