Format is plaintext `<canonicalTelephone>|<lowerEmail>|<householdId>` (NOT hashed). It is surfaced on the DTO in `toOwnerDtoWithDerivedFields(Owner)` (line 367: `ownerDto.setIdentityKey(identityKey(owner));`, lines 362-372). The class-level context (class declaration, dependencies, constructor) is at lines 79-123. The create flow orchestrating everything is `createOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` at lines 193-221.

